        {
          "title": "COMPASS: The explainable agentic framework for Sovereignty, Sustainability, Compliance, and Ethics",
          "title_zh": "COMPASS：面向主权、可持续性、合规与伦理的可解释智能体框架",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.11277v2",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2603.11277",
          "summary": "COMPASS is a multi-agent orchestration framework with an orchestrator and four specialized sub-agents for sovereignty, carbon-aware computing, compliance, and ethics, each using RAG to ground evaluations in verified documents. An LLM-as-judge assigns quantitative scores and explainable justifications, and automated evaluation indicates that RAG integration improves semantic coherence and mitigates hallucination risk.",
