        {
          "title": "FinRule-Bench: A Benchmark for Joint Reasoning over Financial Tables and Principles",
          "title_zh": "FinRule-Bench：面向财务报表与会计原则联合推理的基准",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.11339v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2603.11339",
          "summary": "FinRule-Bench pairs real financial statements with human-curated accounting principles and defines three auditing tasks of increasing difficulty: rule verification, rule identification, and joint rule diagnosis. The authors find that models perform well on isolated rule verification but degrade sharply on rule discrimination and multi-violation diagnosis.",
